# Interview Explanation

“Azure VPN Gateway creates secure IPSec tunnels between on-premises networks and Azure VNets. It performs encryption, decryption, authentication, and routing of traffic securely over the public internet. It is mainly used for hybrid cloud connectivity, remote access, and secure communication between networks.”
